WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.314
During COVID-19, clinicians were treating infection in

00:00:04.314 --> 00:00:08.009
patients who also lived with hypertension and chronic

00:00:08.009 --> 00:00:09.403
medication exposure.

00:00:12.675 --> 00:00:16.314
Soluble ACE2 and angiotensin II are distinct

00:00:16.314 --> 00:00:17.306
measurements

00:00:17.306 --> 00:00:21.612
in the renin-angiotensin system. Their interpretation

00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:23.725
requires clinical context.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:32.134
Our 2022 publication investigated reported differences

00:00:32.134 --> 00:00:32.304
in

00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:36.391
those levels among hypertensive COVID-19 patients

00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:40.477
receiving different antihypertensive medications.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.334
Medication groups, disease severity and confounding

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:51.936
factors matter. A measured level does not reveal the

00:00:51.936 --> 00:00:53.461
entire causal pathway.

00:00:56.633 --> 00:01:00.200
A signal in a patient cohort motivates mechanistic

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.766
investigation. It should not become an unsupported

00:01:03.766 --> 00:01:06.691
instruction to stop or change medication.

00:01:10.258 --> 00:01:13.765
The source article contains the study design and

00:01:13.765 --> 00:01:14.350
results.

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:17.939
This film explains the uncertainty around clinical

00:01:17.939 --> 00:01:20.882
association rather than prescribing care.
